 class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$44,000</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.52.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Reinforced Pickaxe</b>, available exclusively at <b><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></b>, commands a price tag of <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$44,000</span> . Renowned as the best <i>purchasable</i> pickaxe in the game. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Refined from the finest materials, the <b>Reinforced Pickaxe</b> stands tall, crafted from <b>blacksteel</b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Adurite\" title=\"Adurite\">Adurite</a>.</b> Its headpiece, a fusion of <b>blacksteel</b> and <b>Adurite</b>, bears a resemblance to the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a></b>, yet with a distinct and unique design of its own.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <b>Reinforced Pickaxe</b>, alongside its companions in the reinforced tool set, was introduced as part of the highly anticipated <b>Progression Update.</b></li>\n<li>When introduced its original price was <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$266,000</span></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902004030\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 87/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 70/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019494/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.688      1 Template:Pickaxe\n100.00%   36.688      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2456-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902004030 and revision id 18971. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Pickaxes"],"links":[{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Adurite","exists":true},{"title":"Emberbane","exists":true}],"images":["Reinforced_Pickaxe.png","Reinforced_Pickaxe_Boxed.png"]}
